      ],
      "en": "I cry out to God Most High, to God who accomplishes my requests for me.",
      "ko": "내가 지극히 높으신 하나님께 부르짖음이여 곧 나를 위하여 모든 것을 이루시는 하나님께로다",
      "source_text_hash": "dad65cb8bb4e20c15558c127f4df7a9b39ef0c940478b03788b5d8952b810a3a",
      "translation_text_hash": "0e9d250298c3a0ee461ccefcca8d051b76fd0026de0c6ce708f2c82e197c280e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
